1
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:29,840
YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!

2
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,620
Your moves!

3
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,420
It's time to duel!

4
00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:09,997
so what will it be mortal are you
going to hand mokuba over willingly

5
00:01:10,080 --> 00:01:14,077
or do i have to conjure something
to consume your soul forget

6
00:01:14,160 --> 00:01:20,317
it no way you know that i have
the power to back up my threats

7
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:24,900
hand him over this instant or i'll
dispatch you to the graveyard too

8
00:01:26,460 --> 00:01:27,940
Yeah, I remember.

9
00:01:28,240 --> 00:01:31,277
Your evil power comes from
that, the Millennium Ring.

10
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:32,190
That's right.

11
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:35,997
The Millennium Ring not only allows
me to control your friend by Korra,

12
00:01:36,080 --> 00:01:38,962
it gives me many other
magical abilities as well.

13
00:01:39,960 --> 00:01:43,257
So unless you want a more personal
demonstration of my power,

14
00:01:43,340 --> 00:01:44,811
you'll stop resisting me.

15
00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:47,666
Since you know any attempt
would be pointless,

16
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:49,897
why sacrifice yourself when you know I'll

17
00:01:49,980 --> 00:01:52,686
still wind up in possession
of him in the end?

18
00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:55,877
Alright, I give up.

19
00:01:55,960 --> 00:01:57,080
You can have him.

20
00:01:57,500 --> 00:01:58,382
Mokuba's yours.

21
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:02,980
Here, think fast!

22
00:02:09,620 --> 00:02:13,960
Since the evil spirit inside that
necklace is what's controlling Bakura,

23
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:16,318
I've got to get rid of the necklace.

24
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,980
So long, evil spirit.

25
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:23,904
And this time, don't come back!

26
00:02:28,720 --> 00:02:29,900
Good riddance.

27
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:36,480
I will defeat you in one
realm or another, Yugi.

28
00:02:37,380 --> 00:02:38,210
Huh?

29
00:02:38,500 --> 00:02:40,100
It's just like last time.

30
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,437
He's sealing us in another dimension.

31
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:44,400
Cutting me off from my friends.

32
00:02:48,900 --> 00:02:50,280
Where'd they go, Joey?

33
00:02:50,780 --> 00:02:51,680
He got me.

34
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:53,157
This is really spooky.

35
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:56,064
How can we help Yuki when
we can't even see him?

36
00:02:57,820 --> 00:02:59,257
Hey, how about a hand?

37
00:02:59,340 --> 00:03:01,037
Tristan, where have you been?

38
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:02,437
You wouldn't believe it.

39
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:04,814
I've had an adventure and a half today.

40
00:03:06,700 --> 00:03:08,397
Tristan, what happened to those two?

41
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:12,097
That evil spirit took over Bakura again,
and even though I got rid of it...

42
00:03:12,180 --> 00:03:13,010
Huh?

43
00:03:13,093 --> 00:03:13,995
What's going on here?

44
00:03:14,460 --> 00:03:15,300
You first.

45
00:03:15,620 --> 00:03:18,557
I freed Mokuba, but then
Bakura tried to grab him.

46
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:20,346
What did he want with Mokuba?

47
00:03:20,640 --> 00:03:21,480
Details, man.

48
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:24,374
He wanted Mokuba for his new host body.

49
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:26,049
Don't worry, I handled it.

50
00:03:26,600 --> 00:03:27,740
But that's history.

51
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:29,937
What's the deal with
the indoor thunderstorm?

52
00:03:30,020 --> 00:03:30,902
We're not sure.

53
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:34,017
These two should be
all right here for now.

54
00:03:34,100 --> 00:03:35,597
Let's go down and check it out.

55
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:36,510
Pronto.

56
00:03:41,860 --> 00:03:45,157
Pegasus was losing, and he started
ranting something about a shadow game,

57
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:46,797
and an instinct came out of nowhere.

58
00:03:46,880 --> 00:03:48,586
I think they're still inside.

59
00:03:49,140 --> 00:03:49,970
Creepy.

60
00:03:50,780 --> 00:03:53,015
This place always gives me the creeps.

61
00:03:53,220 --> 00:03:56,573
Whenever Pegasus brings me
here, it only means one thing.

62
00:03:56,780 --> 00:03:57,960
A Shadow Game.

63
00:03:59,220 --> 00:04:01,417
You'll find your experience
in the Shadow Realm

64
00:04:01,500 --> 00:04:04,700
this time around will be a
lot harder than your last.

65
00:04:05,220 --> 00:04:08,257
The strain of maintaining
your mind shuffle will make it

66
00:04:08,340 --> 00:04:11,869
more difficult for you to
mentally conjure up your monsters.

67
00:04:12,700 --> 00:04:13,540
He's right.

68
00:04:13,900 --> 00:04:14,960
I feel weak.

69
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:16,355
I'll take over, Yugi.

70
00:04:20,280 --> 00:04:24,000
I think I'm strong enough,
so let's finish our duel now.

71
00:04:26,780 --> 00:04:29,780
You'll be safer if you let
me handle Pegasus, Yugi.

72
00:04:29,940 --> 00:04:32,600
I can survive in this
realm easier than you.

73
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:34,717
But we can't abandon our strategy.

74
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:38,057
It was the only thing keeping
Pegasus from reading our minds.

75
00:04:38,140 --> 00:04:41,960
You're right, and it's the only
reason we have our narrow lead.

76
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:50,100
For my next brilliant move, I play my
Dark Eyes Illusionist in attack mode.

77
00:04:50,280 --> 00:04:51,500
And did I tell you?

78
00:04:51,700 --> 00:04:54,480
It's a monster I created
just for this game.

79
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:58,420
And don't forget, in this
realm, it's as real as you are.

80
00:04:58,620 --> 00:04:59,700
I can see that.

81
00:05:00,140 --> 00:05:04,437
Oh, I know he looks formidable, but what
sort of a threat could he be to you?

82
00:05:04,520 --> 00:05:08,020
He has zero attack points
and zero defense points.

83
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:09,830
Of course,

84
00:05:09,980 --> 00:05:12,337
since it's a monster you've
never seen before today,

85
00:05:12,420 --> 00:05:14,697
you have no way of knowing
its hidden secrets.

86
00:05:14,780 --> 00:05:19,077
And I have been known to keep a few
tricks up my sleeve from time to time.

87
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:19,990
Right, Yugi?

88
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:34,317
I don't know what secrets your
dark eyes illusionist holds,

89
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:37,277
but I'm certain it's not as harmless
as you would like me to believe.

90
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:39,180
I'm sure it's quite dangerous.

91
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:42,040
Yugi, you're so suspicious.

92
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:48,660
I'll lay my curse of dragon on the field.

93
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:50,600
Dragon, come forth!

94
00:05:58,540 --> 00:06:00,775
We've got to keep Pegasus off balance.

95
00:06:00,900 --> 00:06:02,877
We've got to keep switching our minds.

96
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:03,960
All right, Yu-Gi.

97
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:08,977
I think Yu-Gi overestimates
his mental prowess and

98
00:06:09,060 --> 00:06:12,517
underestimates the burden of
fighting a duel in the Shadow Realm.

99
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:14,937
I don't think you have
it in you, Yu-Gi boy.

100
00:06:15,020 --> 00:06:19,961
You now have two creatures to maintain,
Your Curse of Dragon and your Dark Magician.

101
00:06:20,440 --> 00:06:21,860
This is so hard.

102
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:24,240
The string, it hurts.

103
00:06:25,380 --> 00:06:27,733
It's like nothing I've ever felt before.

104
00:06:28,400 --> 00:06:30,560
The whole world is spinning.

105
00:06:31,260 --> 00:06:35,240
Yugi, if this is too much for
you, you should let me take over.

106
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:37,600
Give me a minute.

107
00:06:38,280 --> 00:06:41,220
I just want to try to last out the turn.

108
00:06:41,460 --> 00:06:44,477
He's too young and unskilled
to cope with the stress.

109
00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:49,031
and communicating with that other spirit
splits his concentration even more.

110
00:06:49,460 --> 00:06:52,695
His mental and magical energies
will soon be exhausted.

111
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:57,760
You felt it too, huh?

112
00:06:58,260 --> 00:07:00,380
Yeah, sharp jolt, right in my heart.

113
00:07:00,620 --> 00:07:04,157
Along with the strangest feeling that
something bad has happened to Yugi.

114
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,593
Tell me about it, Teya.

115
00:07:05,760 --> 00:07:08,525
I think that our little
buddy's in big trouble.

116
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:11,080
I know. Huh?

117
00:07:11,260 --> 00:07:12,920
You felt it too? Yeah,

118
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:15,397
maybe it's because we've
all become so tight,

119
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:18,637
but it's like we've developed
some kind of weird link with him,

120
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:19,550
for sure.

121
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:24,860
Yeah, but if we're feeling what he's
feeling, it must be really bad in there.

122
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:27,887
If only there was some
way we could help him.

123
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:30,197
You're looking a little pale, Yugi.

124
00:07:30,280 --> 00:07:33,280
Maybe you should give up
your mindshuffle strategy.

125
00:07:34,440 --> 00:07:35,757
Take a breather.

126
00:07:35,840 --> 00:07:38,017
I can send you back to your world.

127
00:07:38,100 --> 00:07:40,200
Anytime you're ready to surrender.

128
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:43,487
Yugi, for once, Pegasus
is telling the truth.

129
00:07:43,840 --> 00:07:47,781
Your mind just can't handle the
stress of maintaining our monsters.

130
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:50,140
Okay, take over. For now.

131
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:53,360
I'll use my turn to attack
with Curse of Dragon!

132
00:07:58,280 --> 00:08:00,020
An impulsive attack.

133
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:03,737
Precipitated, no doubt, by
his concern for little Yugi.

134
00:08:03,820 --> 00:08:06,440
But in his rush, he's
made a fatal mistake.

135
00:08:07,300 --> 00:08:11,860
Your attack activates Dark Eye's
Illusionist's special ability.

136
00:08:14,620 --> 00:08:15,840
Mesmerizing magic!

137
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:18,840
He stopped him.

138
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:22,757
To make up for Dark Eye's non-existent
attack and defense points,

139
00:08:22,840 --> 00:08:25,140
I endowed him with a special ability.

140
00:08:25,620 --> 00:08:28,977
Dark Eye's Illusionist can
use the power of its mesmeric

141
00:08:29,060 --> 00:08:32,060
eye to paralyze attacking
monsters in their tracks.

142
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:37,077
With such a superb monster at my disposal,
what could my next brilliant move be?

143
00:08:37,160 --> 00:08:40,320
Just play it. As you
wish. Believe it or not,

144
00:08:40,460 --> 00:08:42,577
I'm going to use the Black Illusion Ritual

145
00:08:42,660 --> 00:08:45,320
Card to sacrifice my incredible Dark Eyes.

146
00:08:45,540 --> 00:08:47,540
Has he gone insane, you might ask?

147
00:08:47,700 --> 00:08:51,057
Sacrificing a creature that can
paralyze any monster I play?

148
00:08:51,140 --> 00:08:55,500
No, I'm merely using this ceremony
to create an even better monster.

149
00:08:58,520 --> 00:09:04,720
I hereby sacrifice Dark-Eyed Illusionist
to summon another Spellcaster monster.

150
00:09:05,080 --> 00:09:06,380
Yes, there's more.

151
00:09:07,280 --> 00:09:09,740
The incredible, extraordinary,

152
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:15,420
unforgettable creature
known only as Relinquished.

153
00:09:15,640 --> 00:09:17,020
Quite a looker, huh?

154
00:09:19,280 --> 00:09:21,340
What kind of monster can this be?

155
00:09:21,540 --> 00:09:23,017
I've never seen anything like it.

156
00:09:23,100 --> 00:09:26,340
I'll show you by activating
its special power.

157
00:09:27,300 --> 00:09:30,640
It's even more irresistible
than my previous creature.

158
00:09:37,040 --> 00:09:38,080
Oh, no!

159
00:09:38,540 --> 00:09:39,900
My curse of dragon!

160
00:09:42,780 --> 00:09:44,880
Gone, but not forgotten.

161
00:09:45,820 --> 00:09:47,840
Dark Magician, go now!

162
00:09:48,040 --> 00:09:49,216
Attack Relinquished!

163
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:51,117
Dark Magic Attack!

164
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:53,820
Relinquished, activate
your defense shield.

165
00:09:56,640 --> 00:10:01,400
No, it's using my captured Curse of
Dragon as a shield against the attack.

166
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:06,180
The Dark Magician's attack eliminates
Curse of Dragon from the game.

167
00:10:06,520 --> 00:10:10,000
But since he was your creature,
you lose the life points.

168
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:12,700
By absorbing its opponent's monsters,

169
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:15,917
Relinquished can use them
and their attack and defense

170
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:18,737
points to protect against
any attacking monster.

171
00:10:18,820 --> 00:10:23,114
Sir, relinquished remains unharmed
while the opponent suffers the damage.

172
00:10:23,500 --> 00:10:25,900
Your own attack reduced your life point.

173
00:10:26,160 --> 00:10:30,220
As long as I have relinquished in
play, you're your own worst enemy.

174
00:10:40,060 --> 00:10:42,720
Ooh, how frustrating it must be to be you.

175
00:10:42,900 --> 00:10:45,397
To know you have all these
great monsters in your deck,

176
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:48,997
And if you dare play any of them,
they will be used against you.

177
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:51,500
This game's not over yet, Pegasus.

178
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:53,720
No, but it might as well be.

179
00:10:54,360 --> 00:10:57,160
My monster's unstoppable. Watch!

180
00:10:57,420 --> 00:11:00,680
I activate Relinquished's
Hypnotic Attraction.

181
00:11:05,940 --> 00:11:07,717
Try as he might to resist.

182
00:11:07,800 --> 00:11:12,640
Your dark magician will find my spellcaster
as irresistible as your dragon did.

183
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:15,400
Like your dragon, he'll soon be mine.

184
00:11:22,680 --> 00:11:24,200
No, my dark magician!

185
00:11:27,580 --> 00:11:29,220
It captured him, too!

186
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:36,499
And now it's turned him
into another defense shield.

187
00:11:37,100 --> 00:11:38,340
That's right, Yugi.

188
00:11:38,640 --> 00:11:40,197
You're beginning to catch on.

189
00:11:40,280 --> 00:11:44,677
And this time, I've got one of your most
powerful monsters to use against you.

190
00:11:44,760 --> 00:11:46,995
Not to mention your personal favorite,

191
00:11:47,180 --> 00:11:50,537
but in an attack, he'll take
your light points all the same.

192
00:11:50,620 --> 00:11:53,260
Guess you're not his
favorite. Not anymore.

193
00:11:53,740 --> 00:11:55,093
How can I possibly win?

194
00:11:55,380 --> 00:11:57,737
Any monster I use will
be turned against me.

195
00:11:57,820 --> 00:12:01,717
And even if I come up with another
strategy, Pegasus will know it instantly.

196
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:02,800
We can't give up.

197
00:12:03,060 --> 00:12:05,477
We have to mind shuffle
again long enough for me to

198
00:12:05,560 --> 00:12:08,237
play a card and retreat before
Pegasus can read my mind.

199
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:09,500
It worked before.

200
00:12:09,780 --> 00:12:10,780
It'll work again.

201
00:12:11,140 --> 00:12:12,964
Are you sure you're up to this?

202
00:12:13,060 --> 00:12:15,897
We don't know how long you
can last in the Shadow Realm.

203
00:12:15,980 --> 00:12:17,509
I don't have to last long.

204
00:12:17,700 --> 00:12:19,957
Just long enough to pull one last card.

205
00:12:20,040 --> 00:12:23,597
But if you reach the limits of your
endurance, your soul will be shredded,

206
00:12:23,680 --> 00:12:26,337
dispersed in the Shadow
Realm for all eternity.

207
00:12:26,420 --> 00:12:28,357
Whatever the risk, I have to take it.

208
00:12:28,440 --> 00:12:32,440
For Grandpa's sake, we both have
to trust in the heart of the cards.

209
00:12:39,180 --> 00:12:40,010
I've...

210
00:12:40,093 --> 00:12:41,100
I've got to play fast!

211
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:45,540
It's a little Yugi. He's back.

212
00:12:45,740 --> 00:12:47,152
Some people never learn.

213
00:12:49,800 --> 00:12:54,565
I've got to have faith in the heart of
the cards, because the next card I pull...

214
00:12:55,220 --> 00:12:56,560
might be my last!

215
00:12:57,960 --> 00:13:00,548
Please, make it one
that can defeat Pegasus!

216
00:13:01,660 --> 00:13:02,490
Please!

217
00:13:06,420 --> 00:13:08,557
it's all up to the
spirit of the millennium

218
00:13:08,640 --> 00:13:12,760
puzzle now pegasus i
play one card face down

219
00:13:13,620 --> 00:13:18,140
and for my last move i throw
feral imp in defense mode

220
00:13:21,340 --> 00:13:24,317
at least now there's one card that pegasus

221
00:13:24,400 --> 00:13:27,280
doesn't know about now
maybe we stand a chance

222
00:13:28,180 --> 00:13:31,260
If I try to eat his mind,
they'll just switch again.

223
00:13:31,520 --> 00:13:34,580
So instead, I'll overtax it like this.

224
00:13:35,220 --> 00:13:36,985
Relinquish, prepare to attack.

225
00:13:37,380 --> 00:13:39,500
Use the Dark Magician's power.

226
00:13:40,660 --> 00:13:42,013
Filfered, power attack.

227
00:13:42,400 --> 00:13:43,960
Destroy the Feral Imp.

228
00:13:46,560 --> 00:13:47,840
The Feral Imp!

229
00:13:49,800 --> 00:13:52,280
Yugi, switch now. Quickly.

230
00:13:52,960 --> 00:13:53,790
Yugi?

231
00:13:54,700 --> 00:13:55,857
Yugi! Spirit!

232
00:13:55,940 --> 00:13:59,300
You've got to beat Pegasus.

233
00:14:00,520 --> 00:14:01,700
One down.

234
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:08,460
Feel that?

235
00:14:09,560 --> 00:14:11,678
Something happened to Yugi just now.

236
00:14:12,040 --> 00:14:13,680
I know, but what?

237
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:16,176
Whatever it was, it felt devastating.

238
00:14:17,680 --> 00:14:20,280
He's hurt, or worse.

239
00:14:27,340 --> 00:14:29,000
Yugi! Yugi!

240
00:14:29,680 --> 00:14:31,260
I can't sense his spirit.

241
00:14:31,620 --> 00:14:36,097
I can no longer feel the presence
of his young mind. No. He...

242
00:14:36,180 --> 00:14:37,280
he can't be gone.

243
00:14:37,980 --> 00:14:38,840
Forget him.

244
00:14:39,060 --> 00:14:40,540
The boy was too weak.

245
00:14:40,920 --> 00:14:43,697
It takes a person of
true fortitude to cope

246
00:14:43,780 --> 00:14:46,297
with the harsh unrealities
of the Shadow Realm.

247
00:14:46,380 --> 00:14:47,210
Face it.

248
00:14:47,293 --> 00:14:49,591
Yugi is gone and it's just you and me now.

249
00:14:52,760 --> 00:14:57,457
this is too freaky suddenly i'm not
feeling yugi at all it's like he's

250
00:14:57,540 --> 00:15:01,397
vanished off the face of the planet i
